cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite Hudson Headley as the author and credit OpenAI Codex for developing the
  mathematical arguments, writing the Lean proofs, helping draft the paper, and
  performing the internal review.
title: Stein interiors of transport twistor spaces on simple surfaces
authors:
  - given-names: Hudson
    family-names: Headley
type: software
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: 2026-11-26
repository-code: "https://github.com/hudson-opacity/transport-twistor-stein-release"
abstract: >-
  Lean formalization of Steinness of the transport twistor interior over every
  open base subdomain of a smooth simple conformal disk. Hudson Headley directed
  the project and maintains the release. OpenAI Codex agents developed the
  mathematical arguments, wrote the Lean formalization, helped draft the
  manuscript, and performed the internal review.
